---
import IndustryVisaPage from '../components/IndustryVisaPage.astro';
---
<IndustryVisaPage
  title="Business Visas for Trade Fairs & Exhibitions Abroad | UVS"
  description="Business visas for UK companies exhibiting at or visiting international trade fairs, including the Canton Fair. Exhibitor and visitor invitation letters checked."
  crumb="Trade fairs and exhibitions"
  h1="Business Visas for Trade Fairs and Exhibitions"
  intro="Exhibiting at or visiting an international trade fair? Most countries that need a visa will ask for a business visa backed by an invitation from the organiser. We prepare the application and check the paperwork so your team gets there in time for opening day."
  who={[
    "Exhibitors sending stand staff to international trade shows",
    "Buyers and sourcing teams visiting fairs to meet suppliers",
    "Companies visiting conferences and industry events",
    "Event companies building stands overseas",
  ]}
  visas={[
    ["Business visa", "Visiting or exhibiting at a trade fair, meeting suppliers and attending conferences"],
    ["Work visa or permit", "Stand building and other hands-on work at the venue, in some countries"],
  ]}
  sections={[
    { h: "Invitation letters from the organiser", p: [
      "Many fairs issue invitation letters to registered exhibitors and visitors for visa purposes. The details on the letter must match the passport exactly, and mistakes are a common cause of delays. We check them before you apply.",
    ]},
    { h: "The Canton Fair and other China fairs", p: [
      "The Canton Fair in Guangzhou is one of the most popular trade fairs for UK buyers. Visitors who need a visa usually apply for a China business visa using an invitation linked to their fair registration. As China visa specialists, we handle these applications regularly.",
    ]},
  ]}
  checklist={[
    "Passport with enough validity and blank pages",
    "Invitation letter from the fair organiser or a company you are meeting",
    "Fair registration or exhibitor confirmation",
    "Letter from your company confirming the purpose of the trip",
    "Travel and hotel bookings, where the country asks for them",
  ]}
  faqs={[
    { q: "Do I need a visa to visit a trade fair?", a: "It depends on the country and your nationality. Where a visa is needed, visiting or exhibiting at a fair usually needs a business visa rather than a tourist visa." },
    { q: "How early should we apply for a trade fair visa?", a: "Apply as soon as you have your invitation letter. Visa demand peaks before major fairs, so leaving it late is risky." },
    { q: "Can stand builders use a business visa?", a: "Not always. Some countries treat building a stand as work. We check what each person will be doing." },
  ]}
  related={[["China business visa", "/china-business-visa/"], ["China visa from the UK", "/china-visa-application/"]]}
/>
